## Capability

Present a bounded PDBx structure with sequence-to-residue selection, missing or alternate sites and source-linked annotations. The specimen can open as an independent root.

## Completion checks

- [ ] Select a residue from the sequence and the 3D view, annotate it and reopen offline. Reorder input atoms and retain identity or a visible repair case.

For a Protein Area, retain the required fast Laboratory replay that opens Add filter, reads the choices and selects one. Verify readable text in the actual native UI. [Protein Area requirements](../../Lince.lingua)

